And (p j)\n                    (∀ (x y : α),\n                      Membership.mem.{ua, ua} (s j) (Prod.mk.{ua, ua} x y) →\n                        Membership.mem.{ub, ub} (t i) (Prod.mk.{ub, ub} (f x) (f y))))","unsafe":false,"value":447,"source":{"code":"theorem Filter.HasBasis.uniformContinuous_iff {ι'} [UniformSpace β] {p : ι → Prop}\n    {s : ι → SetRel α α} (ha : (𝓤 α).HasBasis p s) {q : ι' → Prop} {t : ι' → Set (β × β)}\n    (hb : (𝓤 β).HasBasis q t) {f : α → β} :\n    UniformContinuous f ↔ ∀ i, q i → ∃ j, p j ∧ ∀ x y, (x, y) ∈ s j → (f x, f y) ∈ t i :=\n  (ha.tendsto_iff hb).trans <| by simp only [Prod.forall]","start":835,"end":839},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}